OL,3,GNEWSAFoot artist's work chosen for
OL,4,AChristmas card collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor most of his life, Peter Longstaff
OL,7,Fhas used his feet to paint scenic
OL,8,Flandscapes.
OL,10,FThe 65-year-old from Marsham, Norfolk,
OL,11,Fwas born without arms after his mother,
OL,12,FBrenda Longstaff, was prescribed
OL,13,Fthalidomide, a drug used to treat
OL,14,Fmorning sickness that caused severe
OL,15,Fbirth defects in thousands of babies.
OL,17,FShe encouraged her son to use his feet
OL,18,Fas a child and he taught himself how to
OL,19,Fpaint. He later gained a number of art
OL,20,Fqualifications.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
