OL,3,GNEWSAFoot artist's work chosen for
OL,4,AChristmas card collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FLongstaff joined the Mouth and Foot
OL,7,FPainting Artists (MFPA) 24 years ago
OL,8,Fand, for the first time, one of his
OL,9,Fpaintings has been selected for the
OL,10,Forganisation's 2026 Christmas card
OL,11,Fcollection.
